## Quick start

```bash
make setup        # dlv, config/local.yaml, go modules
make db-up        # Postgres in docker on :{{ .Service.DBPort }}
make migrate-up   # apply migrations
make serve        # http://localhost:{{ .Service.Port }}{{ if .Module.GraphQL }}/{{ .Module.Route }}/playground{{ end }}
make cover        # every test, 100% coverage gate
```

`make` with no target lists everything.

## Documentation rule

Every change that adds or changes behaviour updates the docs in the same PR: the module README for
module changes, this README and AGENTS.md for anything repo-wide. Docs are indexed from here.
